71
00:02:43,120 --> 00:02:47,440
never by a desire to simulate human

72
00:02:45,120 --> 00:02:49,120
collaboration. Once you have escalated

73
00:02:47,440 --> 00:02:51,599
the system and isolated your

74
00:02:49,120 --> 00:02:53,920
specialists, you have to define exactly

75
00:02:51,599 --> 00:02:55,760
